GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Text_Register::
    .string "ELM's field researcher?\n"
    .string "We received his introduction.\p"
    .string "Reports from KANTO and JOHTO\n"
    .string "mention the same ROCKET groups.\p"
    .string "We will compare your field\n"
    .string "notes with our radio records.\p"
    .string "WHITNEY asked us to welcome you.\n"
    .string "Her GYM is taking challengers.$"

GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Text_Registered::
    .string "Keep recording what you find.\n"
    .string "ELM and our staff share reports.$"

GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Text_BeforeElm::
    .string "Please report your findings to\n"
    .string "ELM before joining the study.$"

GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Text_Reception::
    .string "Welcome to the RADIO TOWER.\n"
    .string "The research desk is here.$"

@ JOHTO_RADIO_TOWER_RESCUE_V1 LOBBY
GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Text_BroadcastClerkBefore::
    .string "Welcome to the RADIO TOWER.\n"
    .string "Our studios are on the air.\p"
    .string "Travel through JOHTO. Report\n"
    .string "any strange signals to LANCE.$"

GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Text_BroadcastClerkAlarm::
    .string "TEAM ROCKET seized our studios!\n"
    .string "They called for GIOVANNI.\p"
    .string "LANCE traced their lake signal.\n"
    .string "Now they control this station.\p"
    .string "Someone posing as our director\n"
    .string "waits in the third-floor studio.$"

GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Text_BroadcastClerkAfter::
    .string "Our broadcast is normal again.\n"
    .string "Thank you and your partner!\p"
    .string "The director is coordinating\n"
    .string "repairs from the warehouse.$"

GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Text_UpperGateClosed::
    .string "The studios are recording.\n"
    .string "Only staff may use the stairs.$"

GoldenrodCity_RadioTower_1F_Text_RadioNotice::
    .string "JOHTO RADIO NETWORK\n"
    .string "Local news and POKEMON reports.$"

